      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.risk.sensitive_change_public_exposure",
              "name": "risk.sensitive_change_public_exposure",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A change opens a resource to public or unrestricted access"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A change opens a resource to public or unrestricted access"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A change opens a resource to public or unrestricted access. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#sensitive-changes",
                "markdown": "**A change opens a resource to public or unrestricted access.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.risk.sensitive_change_public_exposure\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#sensitive-changes)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#sensitive-changes",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "risk"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
